<title>USA: Ride Chairman Roger Madison to resign.</title>
<headline>Ride Chairman Roger Madison to resign.</headline>
<dateline>PRESTON, Wash. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ride Inc said Friday its chairman and co-founder Roger Madison will resign effective April 18.</p>
<p>The chairman's responsibilities will be absorbed into those of Chief Executive Officer Bob Hall and Chief Financial Officer Scott Stewart, Ride said.</p>
<p>Madison will continue to serve his term on the company's board and assist the company on a contract basis, identifying merger and action candidates, it said.</p>
</text>
